<main>
<p>The Drums page combines a full 12-pad drum kit with four ready-made patterns you can loop hands-free, or tap the pads yourself over the top.</p>

<h2>Patterns</h2>
<p>Choose from four built-in patterns — Simple, Disco, Rock and Breakdown. Tap one to start looping; tap the same one again to stop cleanly at the end of the bar. Switching patterns mid-loop queues the change to land exactly on the next bar, never mid-beat.</p>

<h2>Fill</h2>
<p>Queue a drum fill for the next bar — press Fill at any point and it plays automatically when the current bar ends, then returns to the normal pattern.</p>

<h2>Drum Kit</h2>
<p>Eight pads by default, or switch to 12 for the full kit:</p>
<ul class="guide">
  <li><strong>Kick, Snare, Hi-Hat, Open Hat, Hi Tom, Lo Tom, Crash, Clap</strong> — the core 8-pad kit</li>
  <li><strong>Rim, Cowbell, Shaker, Ride</strong> — added in 12-pad mode</li>
</ul>
<p>Tap any pad any time, whether or not a pattern is playing — they layer over the loop live.</p>

<h2>Tempo &amp; Drum Volume</h2>
<p>Drag the tempo slider for a smooth, continuous glide — already-sounding hits are never cut off mid-note, and drums speed up or slow down seamlessly rather than stuttering. Drum Volume controls the kit independently from the app's master volume.</p>

<h2>Move</h2>
<p>Rearrange the pad layout to suit how you play — enable Move, tap a pad to select it, then tap another to swap their positions.</p>

<h2>Metronome</h2>
<p>A compact metronome sits alongside the drum controls — choose a time signature, pick a click sound, and start or stop it independently of the drum patterns.</p>

